Package: xfce4
Name: Xfce 4 lightweight desktop environment
Version: 4.16.0
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Depends: xfwm4, xfce4-panel, xfce4-settings, xfce4-session, xfdesktop4, xfce4-appfinder, thunar, libxfce4ui-2-0, libgarcon-1-0, libexo-2-0, libxfce4util7, xfconf, libwnck-3-0, libstartup-notification0, dbus
Recommends: x11-fonts-sf
Section: X11
Priority: optional
Description: Xfce 4.16 desktop environment for iOS (metapackage)
 Installs the full lightweight Xfce 4.16 desktop built on the cross-compiled
 GTK3/X11 stack for the selected package profile: the window manager (xfwm4),
 panel, desktop, settings manager, session manager, file manager (Thunar) and
 the application finder, plus the Xfce libraries and their new dependencies
 (xfconf/D-Bus, libwnck-3, startup-notification).
 .
 This is a metapackage: it pulls in the components and the GTK3 runtime
 transitively, but ships no files of its own. It does NOT pull an X server;
 start one separately (the native Xios server, or x11-xvfb) and bring the
 session up with bin/xfce-up.sh on DISPLAY :3. Target profile:
 @REPO_PROFILE@.
